.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-about 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-about \- Show or set a repo\*(Aqs name and description (root or maintainer key)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm about\fR [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPO\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or set a repo\*(Aqs name and description (root or maintainer key)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
New name, at most 64 bytes. "" removes it
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR
New one\-line description, at most 512 bytes. "" removes it
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
A repo ID or link
